==Trivia==
* The four variants of turoth are defined by their names in the game's source code: <code>slayer_turoth_dad</code>, <code>slayer_turoth_mum</code>, <code>slayer_turoth_child</code>, and <code>slayer_turoth_baby</code>.
* Although not found anywhere in game, level 86 and level 88 [[Turoth (unused)|versions]] of turoth exist in the game's data files. They are coloured white and brown instead of pink.

